│ at home or in the community. Although a wide range of telerehabilitation interventions are trialed in persons with   │
│ multiple sclerosis (pwMS), evidence for their effectiveness is unclear.ObjectivesTo investigate the effectiveness    │
│ and safety of telerehabilitation intervention in pwMS for improved patient outcomes. Specifically, this review       │
│ addresses the following questions: does telerehabilitation achieve better outcomes compared with traditional         │
